 "description": "List changes (kunngj\u00f8ringer for companies; role + ownership movements for persons) in the last N days. Use when monitoring a target entity for triggers ('has anything changed for X AS in the last month?'). Pair with `subscribe_company` for push notifications.",
 "inputSchema": {
